{"job_id":"F-533d7b11c63d49e1ab39","family_id":"F-533d7b11c63d49e1ab39","title":"법원조사관 등 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":10,"target_id":"31498169390db1d7b25f89a58510dc94354a426830df46e81a9acc077b863b77","source_hash":"7df449ee1a439ed7c48d320f5a295a496c4c797a7186fb51962e4d5c8172353c","text":"法院调查员等的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":66,"target_id":"f6600d3d55f77e6b29160ffc0013f5c9e73a51dfb3e1360f68fb90eb0a503c7d","source_hash":"a6bfa7a745f7e4d4434590e6db72d18f3beb7c368a9ea8a76b8e1f049718f267","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据法院组织法第54条之3、第4款的规定，规定有关调查人员的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":66,"end":348,"target_id":"8d225e9408e75f7aa433bb0c982648567fa292e9f9312c354bf0c26df0ffe416","source_hash":"e7a8ebd1295bdfae9f2b522df3c72fb6c1dc9697200cac40864d7705a802801e","text":"文章 2（调查员）\n① 法院调查员应当从四级、五级法院官员、定期官员或者依据《法院组织法》第五十四条之三第三款派遣的公职人员中指定。<2009年9月28日修订；2021年6月28日修订>\n② 国内事务调查员、少年案件调查员、家庭保护案件调查员和儿童保护案件调查员应从调查秘书、调查员、调查助理、初级调查员或与其级别相当的定期公务员中选任。但在特殊情况下，可以从法院秘书、法院官员、法院助理或初级法院助理中选任。<2013年12月10日修订；2014年9月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":348,"end":489,"target_id":"d9a0674466c8cd8a30944377d3a222ac450f4cd3214dc944fe11f77ca2b3e740","source_hash":"f3773be9123d48b953a22f70231ed71e9812f073c9f567d8c7f82dcb83e64ed1","text":"第2-1条（法律研究员）\n① 法律研究人员可被任命为最高法院法官。\n法律研究人员应被任命为专门的定期公职人员。\n③ 法律研究人员在法官（司法研究官员）的命令下，收集和调查民事、刑事和行政案件审理所需的材料，并履行其他必要的职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":489,"end":641,"target_id":"d59b89ed8c76c76db4ce1242b779b511afcbabce826a10b5056c5b6afb8d07ae","source_hash":"6fb9669dca5485f8941233358c19e2dc28ea9fe1920cee37c3ff6ff5f94dca57","text":"第3条（首席研究员）\n①首尔家庭法院应指定一名首席调查员。\n②首席调查员应被任命为法院书记员或调查书记员。\n③ 首席调查员在上级指示下，指导和监督家庭案件调查员、青少年案件调查员、家庭保护案件调查员和儿童保护案件调查员，并监督他们的工作。<2014年9月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":641,"end":663,"target_id":"aa688951b07822eb7d8c3b0176c9f9d07cf7b25b0847d215c620fffad0975524","source_hash":"2a2188ac88129c5973383aaca03cd913713b90bf62440de65cbe89e11dd17d45","text":"补充规定 <第1841号，2003年9月3日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":663,"end":695,"target_id":"eb3e4faf2ff3dfee7a2e079967e81d942c3d3a18b3c9f5e7d4c680bfe5bdf688","source_hash":"f62d4ee7e3afeede0a93e0ca8e8460ec27e1d3dde75f6549b5b0c9ca43d4dc2b","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":695,"end":790,"target_id":"f0efd885cbd6428c35fb8df62cd7ca538fc6e925747058991ac721f34f0504db","source_hash":"5fc8aceae03310d0b13e08e312ce4ffecd4e897a2566848d7e7ad1c61cc37464","text":"第二条（过渡措施）本规则实施时法院调查员、家庭调查员、青少年调查员和家庭保护案件调查员，应视为本规则下的法院调查员、家庭调查员、青少年调查员和家庭保护案件调查员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":790,"end":828,"target_id":"5497e7fd90b712f3de85397cd81af48c7e53a4af37568b04c4d85318f4a32fc0","source_hash":"efbd8cd78c7e52c558594c041bbf672a7ef9473f1cfacb1a17babf89dee98b8b","text":"第3条（修改其他规则）删除国内保护规则第15条。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":828,"end":872,"target_id":"e32cb9f8c6743836d5097d5ec100c074aec2262e12672c0670d06dd854860a16","source_hash":"e5827081f50fcae7b52bfc4b20c85a631aa995a4e7c026f707786b4896ca010b","text":"补充规定 <第2253号，2009年9月28日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":872,"end":905,"target_id":"333e2e8240ac79c39060b97912bba1b4aa14a557a9ca434ce84fcb52e63ef504","source_hash":"ff970ce15c61f3f93ba9ab980acae9468694e6a0c21909d3f07b60f6fc546f41","text":"补充规定（法院官员规则）<2507号，2013年12月10日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":905,"end":951,"target_id":"6acb577d7a86e9e1cea126ec8477c6e4aae1ad40b578748594d16b213e469da2","source_hash":"b6e4be478a06911608d145a2a059ed8ec0da712766a2871147519936b8faf0b7","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2013年12月12日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":951,"end":968,"target_id":"2815b025c9a38af709b299cf28bed32ecf542aaa983d5632d908f56cdf487b29","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":968,"end":1082,"target_id":"7090e1459a518eb06f7516a6b3c2a9fcfcd449c316aad03b4913fc824e3109eb","source_hash":"b93cb28d529805bc64c7185c054eec750bda4a399b82d71a8fe1c083cd9a1cae","text":"第八条（其他规则的修改）①至③ 已省略\n\n  ④ 《法院调查员等规则》部分修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第二款正文中，“合同制公务员”应改为“定期公务员”。\n\n  省略⑤至⑧\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1082,"end":1114,"target_id":"a8d9c7aae9d607d4a9311d5a6d6ede6a06e1498e6192d4b3ed9a0ec05d256375","source_hash":"2e28f6d33ebae2c5401b0375ac5a342496934b2cab16eab9f023f87309c4c929","text":"补充规定（儿童保护裁决规则）<第2556号，2014年9月1日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1114,"end":1151,"target_id":"64e40a3494a9dfe357567ce7abe3749b0cfffa2be761e75a02999edd1b040c64","source_hash":"0acb6cd0160f1c753adc2fbcd2507d3d8c5f299a0ffb4bf72c0cd52ac1d6582d","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2014年9月29日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1151,"end":1159,"target_id":"d4ba8f0de366472dcdd7c3278789a7a9997d046e50f9b2777291e7536de7524b","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"条款 2 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1159,"end":1390,"target_id":"0e0a648a261c3e5a4227531d3a544f711d698c42448a283c18a6b1094da19f7d","source_hash":"3ed28f8a499dab840b7812801fa13e722ee063d7befafb8728dd60db5aa225b9","text":"第三条（其他规则的修改）①和②已省略\n\n  ③ 《法院调查员等规则》部分修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第二款正文中，“家庭调查员、青少年案件调查员和家庭保护案件调查员”应改为“家庭调查员、青少年案件调查员、家庭保护案件调查员和儿童保护案件调查员”。\n\n  第3条第3款中的“家庭调查员、青少年案件调查员和家庭保护案件调查员”应改为“家庭调查员、青少年案件调查员、家庭保护案件调查员和儿童保护案件调查员”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1390,"end":1440,"target_id":"7cc97cfee82fe60a4b9e18ba4101292819d3aab903954219e95cc7601f6574b0","source_hash":"60252808f857636946311d69e508df57443e4c8c69a251eaaf37a237d41618a2","text":"补充规定 <第2796号，2018年6月28日>\n\n该规定自2018年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009548-233435-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1440,"end":1482,"target_id":"c8fa474e77d87e1943a587533d1e306120e79ae505ae9fe6c3f16de93ccd6820","source_hash":"fca0842e366891da08bc39792f9911c3257f7fbb548da890e8d13a2115ef01cd","text":"补充规定 <2991号，2021年6月28日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。"}]}